cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PlateMate"
message: >-
  If you use this software in academic work, please cite the OZCHI '25 paper
  rather than the repository itself.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Research artifact for the OZCHI '25 paper "PlateMate: Structured Guidance
  Design in Relatedness Technology for Remote Joint Activity". PlateMate is a
  Django REST and Vue 3 application in which geographically separated partners
  cook in weekly rounds, submit photographs of the result for AI judging, and
  raise a shared virtual pet from the outcome.
